3	/**
4	 * Derives an owner's marketing segment '&lt;TIER&gt;_&lt;AREA&gt;'. TIER is 'PREMIUM' when the
5	 * owner's membership level is 3 or more, otherwise 'STANDARD'. AREA is 'METRO' when the owner's
6	 * {@link OwnerRegion region} is a {@link CityRegion#isKnown known region} (NSW, VIC or QLD),
7	 * otherwise 'REGIONAL'.
